{"step_index":707,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T08:36:59Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the Image Issue**\n\nI'm currently investigating the \"hình lỗi rồi\" issue related to `bin_base.svg`. My focus is shifting to `intro_act1_wardrobe.svg`. It seems the issue is that it is lacking the beautiful rendering described, missing the warm inviting bedroom feel with cozy lighting, and a certain Bé is missing from the image.\n\n\n**Redesigning the Bedroom Scene**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in redesigning `intro_act1_wardrobe.svg` to be a vibrant storybook illustration. My vision is crystallizing: a cozy bedroom with warm wood floors, pastel cream walls, a window framing a blue sky with cute pastel curtains, and a colorful woolen rug. The wardrobe itself will be a focal point, crafted from oak and realistically open with hanging clothes and neatly arranged drawers. I'm focusing on those specific details now.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 450\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n  <defs>\n    <!-- Wall & Floor Gradients -->\n    <linearGradient id=\"wallPastel\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFF8E1\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"60%\" stop-color=\"#FFECB3\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#FFE082\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"woodFloor\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#BCAAA4\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#8D6E63\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"wardrobeWood\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFA726\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#E65100\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"wardrobeInner\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFF3E0\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#FFE0B2\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"skinGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFE0B2\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#FFCC80\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"yellowShirt\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFF59D\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#FDD835\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"bluePants\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#90CAF9\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#42A5F5\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <filter id=\"softShadow\" x=\"-10%\" y=\"-10%\" width=\"120%\" height=\"120%\">\n      <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"6\" stdDeviation=\"6\" flood-color=\"#000\" flood-opacity=\"0.14\"/>\n    </filter>\n  </defs>\n\n  <!-- 1. TƯỜNG PHÒNG NGỦ ẤM ÁP -->\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"320\" fill=\"url(#wallPastel)\"/>\n  \n  <!-- Cửa sổ phòng ngủ nhìn ra trời xanh -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(480, 40)\">\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"140\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#B3E5FC\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"8\"/>\n    <!-- Khung kính -->\n    <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n    <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n    <!-- Đám mây ngoài cửa sổ -->\n    <ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"50\" rx=\"25\" ry=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"45\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n    <!-- Rèm cửa màu cam nhạt xinh xắn -->\n    <path d=\"M -10 -5 Q 10 70 -5 140 L -15 140 Z\" fill=\"#FFAB91\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 150 -5 Q 130 70 145 140 L 155 140 Z\" fill=\"#FFAB91\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Bức tranh nhỏ máy bay trên tường -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(340, 60)\">\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FFB74D\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"20,40 50,20 60,45 35,42\" fill=\"#0288D1\"/>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- 2. SÀN GỖ & THẢM TRÒN -->\n  <rect y=\"320\" width=\"800\" height=\"130\" fill=\"url(#woodFloor)\"/>\n  <!-- Các vân sàn gỗ -->\n  <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"800\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#795548\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n  <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"405\" x2=\"800\" y2=\"405\" stroke=\"#795548\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#795548\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n  <line x1=\"420\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"405\" stroke=\"#795548\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n  <line x1=\"650\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"650\" y2=\"360\" stroke=\"#795548\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n\n  <!-- Thảm tròn êm ái dưới chân Bin -->\n  <ellipse cx=\"440\" cy=\"385\" rx=\"160\" ry=\"42\" fill=\"#FFE082\" stroke=\"#FFD54F\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <ellipse cx=\"440\" cy=\"385\" rx=\"130\" ry=\"32\" fill=\"#FFF9C4\"/>\n\n  <!-- 3. TỦ QUẦN ÁO MỞ CÁNH (WARDROBE) -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(60, 45)\" filter=\"url(#softShadow)\">\n    <!-- Thân tủ gỗ -->\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"320\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"url(#wardrobeWood)\" stroke=\"#BF360C\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n    <!-- Lòng tủ màu kem sáng -->\n    <rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"210\" height=\"240\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"url(#wardrobeInner)\" stroke=\"#FFA726\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n    \n    <!-- Thanh treo quần áo -->\n    <rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"190\" height=\"8\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#8D6E63\"/>\n\n    <!-- Móc treo 1: Áo thun vàng máy bay mềm mại -->\n    <g transform=\"translate(45, 48)\">\n      <path d=\"M 18 0 Q 18 -12 25 -12 Q 32 -12 32 -4\" stroke=\"#78909C\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 0 10 L 50 10 L 45 65 L 5 65 Z\" fill=\"url(#yellowShirt)\" stroke=\"#F57F17\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"6\"/>\n      <polygon points=\"20,35 32,25 38,38 28,36\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n    </g>\n\n    <